
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor User
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as API Service
    participant BE as FastAPI Backend
    participant TG as Ticket Generator
    participant AIP as AI Processor
    participant CLS as Classifiers
    participant EMB as Embedding Layer
    participant CLU as Clustering Layer
    participant CACHE as In Memory Cache

    Note over BE,CACHE: Startup Flow
    BE->>TG: Load tickets
    TG-->>BE: Ticket list
    BE->>AIP: Process tickets

    AIP->>CLS: Add symptom labels
    CLS-->>AIP: Symptoms
    AIP->>CLS: Add taxonomy categories
    CLS-->>AIP: Categories
    AIP->>CLS: Add dynamic categories
    CLS-->>AIP: Dynamic categories

    AIP->>EMB: Normalize text
    EMB-->>AIP: Normalized text
    AIP->>EMB: Generate embeddings
    EMB-->>AIP: Semantic vectors
    AIP->>CLU: Cluster tickets
    CLU-->>AIP: Cluster labels

    AIP->>AIP: Compute confidence
    AIP->>AIP: Compute summaries
    AIP->>AIP: Compute trends and metrics
    AIP-->>BE: Insights payload
    BE->>CACHE: Save insights

    Note over User,CACHE: Read Flow
    User->>FE: Open dashboard
    FE->>API: Get insights
    API->>BE: GET insights
    BE->>CACHE: Read cached insights
    CACHE-->>BE: Insights
    BE-->>API: Response
    API-->>FE: Insights data
    FE-->>User: Render dashboard

    Note over User,CACHE: Duplicate Check
    User->>FE: Enter issue text
    FE->>API: Check duplicate
    API->>BE: POST duplicate check
    BE->>AIP: Run similarity check
    AIP-->>BE: Match result
    BE-->>API: Duplicate response
    API-->>FE: Confidence and similar tickets
    FE-->>User: Show duplicate result

    Note over User,CACHE: Mutation Flow
    User->>FE: Create or update ticket
    FE->>API: Send mutation
    API->>BE: POST request
    BE->>AIP: Reprocess tickets
    AIP-->>BE: Updated insights
    BE->>CACHE: Refresh cache
    BE-->>API: Success response
    API-->>FE: Updated state
    FE-->>User: Refreshed dashboard

